      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَفِيْئَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A piece of meat stripped off,</i> or <i>peeled off,
from a bone:</i> (TA:) <i>a piece of meat in which is
no bone:</i> (S:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَفِىْءٌ</span> [but this is rather a coll.
gen. n., or it is doubtful] and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَفَايَا</span>. (TA.)

